      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " The ether is everywhere — in the smoke and in the clean air — and the smoke never sticks to it. Osho draws the daily application: the Self is in the angry thought and the peaceful thought, the same presence in both, and the anger no more stains it than smoke stains the sky. When you are angry, the anger is in the field; the witness watching the anger is untouched — you can verify this even now. The one who notices \"anger is arising\" is not itself angry. Rest in that noticing, and the taint that once seemed permanent dissolves into what it always was: weather in the ether."]
